ocated to the south of Pokhara at Rambazaar on the eastern bank of Seti river.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Pokhara Rangasala","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/Pokhararangasala_.jpg/1280px-Pokhararangasala_.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/Pokhararangasala_.jpg/500px-Pokhararangasala_.jpg","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"Glantiwehene","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pokhararangasala_.jpg"}},{"id":"pokhara_wv_sarangkot","areaId":"pokhara","name":"Sarangkot","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":28.24497,"lng":83.94876},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"pokhara_wv_sarangkot","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":107,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-23"},"hashtags":["sarangkotpokhara","pokhara"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:30","close":"17:30"},{"open":"12:30","close":"17:30"},{"open":"12:30","close":"17:30"},{"open":"12:30","close":"17:30"},{"open":"12:30","close":"17:30"},{"open":"12:30","close":"17:30"},{"open":"12:30","close":"17:30"}]},"summary":"The perfect pre-trek warm-up. Head up Sarangkot, and be prepared as it's steep and hard work. You can rent a motor bike or use the cable car to go to the top. The road is rough, but traversable. Great views, spectacular images and a great way to get a taste of what it's like to be trekking.The Sarangkot south slope trail is a challenging run/polewalk workout. Go north through Lakeside about 5&nbsp","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pokhara","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Sarangkot%2C_Nepal-WLV-1665.jpg/1280px-Sarangkot%2C_Nepal-WLV-1665.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Sarangkot%2C_Nepal-WLV-1665.jpg/500px-Sarangkot%2C_Nepal-WLV-1665.jpg","w":1200,"h":800,"author":"Bijay Chaurasia","license":"C