rly mornings are impressive. Hire a boat and row yourself across the lake, or hire a local to do it for you – there are some fine times to be had on this lake, even in the middle of the night.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pokhara"},{"id":"pokhara_wv_kahun_dharahara","areaId":"pokhara","name":"Kahun Dharahara","category":"landmark","tags":["views","photo"],"location":{"lat":28.23806,"lng":84.0136},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"pokhara_wv_kahun_dharahara","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-23"},"hashtags":["kahundharahara","pokhara"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"10:00","close":"19:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"19:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"19:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"19:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"19:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"19:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"19:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"sunset","summary":"Kahun is the second nearest hill close to the city. At the top of Kahun there's a view tower locally called \"Kahun Dharhara\". You can get there by bus, motorbike or cycle. Hiking also shouldn't take more than 2½ hours to reach there from Ranipauwa. A spectacular view of Annapurna range can be seen straight from the tower. The Pokhara valley can also be observed. The environment is peaceful at the ","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pokhara"},{"id":"pokhara_wv_asian_teahouse","areaId":"pokhara","name":"Asian Teahouse","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":28.21105,"lng":83.95756},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"pokhara_wv_asian_teahouse","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["asianteahouse","pokhara"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Located along the main road through Lakeside on the opposite side from the lake. The only way you'll find this place is to look out for the handwritten sign sitting at the end of the alleyway that the restaurant sits in. Or by looking for a large shop named 'Almonds'; directly under this sign is an arcade that you walk through and it is at the end on the left. The food is great, huge servings and ","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pokhara"},{"id":"pokhara_wv_natssul_korean_restaurant","areaId":"pokhara","name":"Natssul Korean Restaurant","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":28.20429,"lng":83.96346},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"pokhara_wv_natssul_korean_restaurant","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.natssul.com","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["natssulkoreanrestaurant","pokhara"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Next to Lakeview Resort towards the tourist bus stand end of town, this is an outdoor garden restaurant run by a Korean couple and serves authentic Korean dishes. Recommended are Vege Bibimbob Hotpot, Beef Bulgogi stew and pork skewers. Free Wi-Fi and the complimentary side dishes are lovely.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pokhara"},{"id":"pokhara_wv_german_bakery","areaId":"pokhara","name":"German Bakery","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":28.19648,"lng":83.96984},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"pokhara_wv_german_bakery","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["germanbakery","pokhara"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Another location of this popular bakery chain. This one is especially good if you're walking into town from the airport or on your way to or from the hike to the World Peace Pagoda. Several tables, free Wi-Fi, good breakfasts including honey curd muesli as well as the usual bakery items.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pokhara"},{"id":"pokhara_wv_pokhara_thakali_kitchen","areaId":"pokhara","name":"Pokhara Thakali Kitchen","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":28.205,"lng":83.96248},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"pokhara_wv_pokhara_thakali_kitchen","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["pokharathakalikitchen","pokhara"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"}]},"summary":"Authentic Thakali meals (including Daal Bhat) served on a large platter with several different curries. One of the best places to eat in Pokhara if you're looking for authentic regional dishes.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pokhara"},{"id":"pokhara_wv_oxygen_lounge_bar","areaId":"pokhara","name":"Oxygen Lounge Bar","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":28.2091,"lng":83.957},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"pokhara_wv_oxygen_lounge_bar","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["oxygenloungebar","pokhara"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"It's a great place located in the centre of lakeside with beautiful view of lake and mountains from the garden of the bar. Live band every night, and late night camp fire.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pokhara"},{"id":"pokhara_wv_pokhara_java_coffee_house","areaId":"pokhara","name":"Pokhara Java Coffee House","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":28.2139,"lng":83.9587},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"pokhara_wv_pokhara_java_coffee_house","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["pokharajavacoffeehouse","pokhara"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Nice and cosy coffee place, that serves breakfast, sandwiches and different varieties of coffee. Their set breakfast includes eggs, toast, hash browns and espresso coffee.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pokhara"},{"id":"pokhara_wv_club_catwalk","areaId":"pokhara","name":"Club Catwalk","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":28.21875,"lng":83.9583},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"pokhara_wv_club_catwalk","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://catwalkpokhara.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["clubcatwalk","pokhara"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"22:30","close":"23:59"},{"open":"22:30","close":"23:59"},{"open":"22:30","close":"23:59"},{"open":"22:30","close":"23:59"},{"open":"22:30","close":"23:59"},{"open":"22:30","close":"23:59"},{"open":"22:30","close":"23:59"}]},"bestLight":"night","summary":"High-energy nightclub with resident DJs, VIP zone, lounge bar, and regular themed nights and live concerts. Free pick-up and drop-off van service available from Lakeside.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Pokhara"},{"id":"pokhara_wv_tara_s_restaurant_nepalese_vegetar